  "goodToKnow": "Die Legitimation is legitimation or legitimacy: demokratische Legitimation (through elections), die Legitimation einer Entscheidung. In formal contexts, it also means proof of identity: eine Legitimation vorzeigen. Legitim means legitimate, and legitimieren means to legitimise or, reflexively, to prove one's identity. Die Legitimität is a close synonym. Plural: die Legitimationen."
